### 회원가입
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/members
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "minji@pokethub.com",
  "password": "pokethub1234!",
  "nickname": "민지"
}

### 로그인
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "minji@pokethub.com",
  "password": "pokethub1234!"
}

> {% client.global.set("accessToken", response.body.data.accessToken); %}

### 파일 업로드 커밋 - repoId 1 저장소
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/teams/1/commits
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=multiBoundary

--multiBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="commitMessage"

업로드 테스트 커밋입니다.
--multiBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="sample1.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

first file sample
--multiBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="sample2.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

second file sample
--multiBoundary--

### 파일 삭제 커밋 - 파일이 존재하지 않음
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/teams/1/commits/99999?commitMessage=DeleteNoFile
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 파일 삭제 커밋 - 과거 상태 파일
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/teams/1/commits/1?commitMessage=DeleteOldFile
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 파일 삭제 커밋 - 최신 파일 ID
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/teams/1/commits/22?commitMessage=DELETECOMMIT
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 커밋 목록 조회 - 1페이지
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/teams/1/commits?page=0
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 커밋 목록 조회 - 2페이지
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/teams/1/commits?page=1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 커밋 목록 조회 - Pr 가능한 목록
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/teams/1/commits?usePr=true

### 커밋 상세 조회 - 존재하지 않는 커밋
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/teams/1/commits/aaa
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 커밋 상세 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/teams/1/commits/6ad604de-14ff-4483-8d7e-fe68ad1dad9a
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 커밋 파일 다운로드
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/teams/1/commits/8a89659c-a015-48ff-b67c-e084d64f7491/download
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 커밋 파일 다운로드 - 삭제 커밋
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/teams/1/commits/be2255f1-b557-4f84-8116-8cbad14f83de/download
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 커밋 파일 다운로드 - 존재하지 않는 커밋
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/teams/1/commits/aaaaa/download
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}